{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_997.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"acb945ce7c0e2ff6edecd942e17888d439d6a24e7a688d10e99a1a572765d146","ja":"……うーん、ダメね。直感系の問題って、思考の迷路に\n陥ると、ぜんぜん解けなくなっちゃうのよね……。","zh":"……嗯——不行呢。直觉类的问题一旦陷入思考的迷宫，就完全解不出来了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
