{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_997.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"4955b2f0142194adbf53745bf1c75ce8afa6e53fc77ac28778b4e632fb49e092","ja":"わっ！　ブザーに赤く点滅するランプまで！\nこれって、制限時間が近いってことよね！？","zh":"哇！不仅有蜂鸣器，连灯都在闪红光！\n这就说明时间限制快到了吧！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
